{
  "$schema": "https://ui.shadcn.com/schema/registry-item.json",
  "name": "dock",
  "type": "registry:ui",
  "title": "Dock",
  "description": "macOS-style interactive magnification dock with pure CSS smooth scaling.",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "dependencies": [],
  "devDependencies": [],
  "registryDependencies": [
    "tokens",
    "motion"
  ],
  "files": [
    {
      "name": "dock.html",
      "path": "ui/dock.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"dark\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Dock - Plain UI</title>\n  <style>\n    /* Design System Tokens */\n    :root {\n      --bg-canvas: #09090b;\n      --bg-surface: #121215;\n      --bg-surface-raised: #18181b;\n      --border-subtle: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n      --border-strong: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);\n      --text-primary: #f4f4f5;\n      --text-secondary: #a1a1aa;\n      --text-tertiary: #71717a;\n      --accent-primary: #6366f1;\n      --font-sans: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;\n      --font-mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;\n      \n      /* Apple Spring Curve */\n      --motion-ease-dock: cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n      --motion-dur-dock: 240ms;\n    }\n\n    *, *::before, *::after {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      font-family: var(--font-sans);\n      background-color: var(--bg-canvas);\n      color: var(--text-primary);\n      line-height: 1.5;\n      padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 6rem;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    }\n\n    .plain-container {\n      max-width: 1120px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n\n    /* Header */\n    .plain-header {\n      margin-bottom: 3rem;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n      padding-bottom: 2rem;\n    }\n\n    .plain-badge {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 0.5rem;\n      padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;\n      border-radius: 9999px;\n      background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.25);\n      color: #60a5fa;\n      font-size: 0.75rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      margin-bottom: 1rem;\n    }\n\n    .plain-title {\n      font-size: 2.5rem;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n      color: #ffffff;\n      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n    }\n\n    .plain-subtitle {\n      font-size: 1.125rem;\n      color: var(--text-secondary);\n      max-width: 680px;\n    }\n\n    .plain-showcase-box {\n      background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 100%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.12), transparent 65%),\n                  var(--bg-surface);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n      border-radius: 20px;\n      padding: 4rem 2rem 3rem;\n      margin-bottom: 3.5rem;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      min-height: 320px;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n\n    /* ==========================================================================\n       Plain UI - macOS Proximity Dock (Pure CSS :has() + Anchor Positioning)\n       Zero Lines of JavaScript.\n       ========================================================================== */\n\n    .plain-dock-wrapper {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: flex-end;\n      gap: 0.625rem;\n      padding: 0.625rem 0.875rem;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(28px) saturate(190%);\n      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(28px) saturate(190%);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      border-radius: 24px;\n      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6),\n                  inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);\n      position: relative;\n      user-select: none;\n    }\n\n    /* Individual Dock Item */\n    .plain-dock-item {\n      position: relative;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      width: 52px;\n      height: 52px;\n      border-radius: 14px;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n      color: #ffffff;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transform-origin: bottom center;\n      transition: transform var(--motion-dur-dock) var(--motion-ease-dock),\n                  width var(--motion-dur-dock) var(--motion-ease-dock),\n                  height var(--motion-dur-dock) var(--motion-ease-dock),\n                  margin var(--motion-dur-dock) var(--motion-ease-dock),\n                  background-color var(--motion-dur-dock);\n    }\n\n    .plain-dock-icon {\n      width: 28px;\n      height: 28px;\n      transition: transform var(--motion-dur-dock) var(--motion-ease-dock);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n    }\n\n    .plain-dock-icon svg {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4));\n    }\n\n    /* Active Running App Dot Indicator */\n    .plain-dock-dot {\n      position: absolute;\n      bottom: -4px;\n      width: 4px;\n      height: 4px;\n      border-radius: 9999px;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);\n      box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);\n      pointer-events: none;\n    }\n\n    /* Dock Divider */\n    .plain-dock-divider {\n      width: 1px;\n      height: 38px;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      margin: 0 0.25rem 6px;\n      border-radius: 1px;\n    }\n\n    /* ==========================================================================\n       Pure CSS :has() Proximity Physics Engine\n       ========================================================================== */\n\n    /* 1. Target Hovered Item */\n    .plain-dock-item:hover {\n      transform: translateY(-16px) scale(1.45);\n      margin: 0 0.45rem;\n      z-index: 10;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      box-shadow: 0 12px 24px -6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\n    }\n\n    /* 2. Immediate Right Sibling (+1) */\n    .plain-dock-item:hover + .plain-dock-item {\n      transform: translateY(-9px) scale(1.24);\n      margin: 0 0.25rem;\n      z-index: 5;\n    }\n\n    /* 3. Immediate Left Sibling (-1 via :has) */\n    .plain-dock-item:has(+ .plain-dock-item:hover) {\n      transform: translateY(-9px) scale(1.24);\n      margin: 0 0.25rem;\n      z-index: 5;\n    }\n\n    /* 4. Second Right Sibling (+2) */\n    .plain-dock-item:hover + .plain-dock-item + .plain-dock-item {\n      transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.10);\n      z-index: 2;\n    }\n\n    /* 5. Second Left Sibling (-2 via :has) */\n    .plain-dock-item:has(+ .plain-dock-item + .plain-dock-item:hover) {\n      transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.10);\n      z-index: 2;\n    }\n\n    /* ==========================================================================\n       CSS Anchor Positioning & Zero-JS Tooltips\n       ========================================================================== */\n\n    /* Anchor Names */\n    .dock-finder   { anchor-name: --dock-finder; }\n    .dock-safari   { anchor-name: --dock-safari; }\n    .dock-terminal { anchor-name: --dock-terminal; }\n    .dock-code     { anchor-name: --dock-code; }\n    .dock-music    { anchor-name: --dock-music; }\n    .dock-chat     { anchor-name: --dock-chat; }\n    .dock-settings { anchor-name: --dock-settings; }\n    .dock-trash    { anchor-name: --dock-trash; }\n\n    /* Tooltip Bubble */\n    .plain-dock-tooltip {\n      position: absolute;\n      bottom: calc(100% + 14px);\n      left: 50%;\n      transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(4px);\n      padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      background: rgba(24, 24, 27, 0.92);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n      color: #ffffff;\n      font-size: 0.75rem;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      letter-spacing: 0.01em;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      pointer-events: none;\n      opacity: 0;\n      transition: opacity 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s var(--motion-ease-dock);\n      box-shadow: 0 8px 16px -4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n      z-index: 100;\n    }\n\n    .plain-dock-item:hover .plain-dock-tooltip {\n      opacity: 1;\n      transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0);\n    }\n\n    /* CSS Native Anchor Positioning Progressive Enhancement */\n    @supports (position-anchor: --dock-finder) {\n      .plain-dock-item:hover .plain-dock-tooltip {\n        position-area: top;\n        margin-bottom: 12px;\n      }\n    }\n\n    /* Tooltip Arrow */\n    .plain-dock-tooltip::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 100%;\n      left: 50%;\n      transform: translateX(-50%);\n      border-width: 4px;\n      border-style: solid;\n      border-color: rgba(24, 24, 27, 0.92) transparent transparent transparent;\n    }\n\n    /* ==========================================================================\n       Dock Variations: Vertical Sidebar Dock\n       ========================================================================== */\n\n    .plain-dock-vertical {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 0.625rem;\n      padding: 0.875rem 0.625rem;\n      border-radius: 24px;\n      transform-origin: center left;\n    }\n\n    .plain-dock-vertical .plain-dock-item {\n      transform-origin: center left;\n    }\n\n    .plain-dock-vertical .plain-dock-item:hover {\n      transform: translateX(12px) scale(1.42);\n      margin: 0.45rem 0;\n    }\n\n    .plain-dock-vertical .plain-dock-item:hover + .plain-dock-item {\n      transform: translateX(7px) scale(1.22);\n      margin: 0.25rem 0;\n    }\n\n    .plain-dock-vertical .plain-dock-item:has(+ .plain-dock-item:hover) {\n      transform: translateX(7px) scale(1.22);\n      margin: 0.25rem 0;\n    }\n\n    .plain-dock-vertical .plain-dock-tooltip {\n      bottom: auto;\n      left: calc(100% + 14px);\n      top: 50%;\n      transform: translateY(-50%) translateX(-4px);\n    }\n\n    .plain-dock-vertical .plain-dock-item:hover .plain-dock-tooltip {\n      transform: translateY(-50%) translateX(0);\n    }\n\n    .plain-dock-vertical .plain-dock-tooltip::after {\n      top: 50%;\n      left: auto;\n      right: 100%;\n      transform: translateY(-50%);\n      border-color: transparent rgba(24, 24, 27, 0.92) transparent transparent;\n    }\n\n    /* Technical Docs */\n    .plain-doc-section {\n      background: var(--bg-surface);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n      border-radius: 16px;\n      padding: 2rem;\n      margin-top: 3.5rem;\n    }\n\n    .plain-code-block {\n      background: #000000;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      padding: 1.25rem;\n      font-family: var(--font-mono);\n      font-size: 0.8125rem;\n      color: #e4e4e7;\n      overflow-x: auto;\n      line-height: 1.6;\n      margin-top: 1rem;\n    }\n\n    .token-prop { color: #93c5fd; }\n    .token-val { color: #f472b6; }\n    .token-tag { color: #6ee7b7; }\n    .token-comment { color: #71717a; font-style: italic; }\n\n    /* Accessibility */\n    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n      .plain-dock-item {\n        transition: none !important;\n      }\n      .plain-dock-item:hover,\n      .plain-dock-item:hover + .plain-dock-item,\n      .plain-dock-item:has(+ .plain-dock-item:hover) {\n        transform: none !important;\n        margin: 0 !important;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"plain-container\">\n    <!-- Header -->\n    <header class=\"plain-header\">\n      <div class=\"plain-badge\">Modern CSS Architecture</div>\n      <h1 class=\"plain-title\">macOS Proximity Dock</h1>\n      <p class=\"plain-subtitle\">\n        Fluid macOS magnification dock using modern CSS <code>:has()</code> relational selectors and CSS Anchor Positioning. Experience realistic proximity physics without JavaScript.\n      </p>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Showcase 1: macOS Bottom Desktop Dock -->\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 2rem;\">\n      <h2 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #ffffff;\">macOS Desktop Shelf</h2>\n      <div class=\"plain-showcase-box\">\n        <nav class=\"plain-dock-wrapper\" aria-label=\"macOS Application Dock\">\n          <!-- Finder -->\n          <a href=\"#finder\" class=\"plain-dock-item dock-finder\" aria-label=\"Finder\">\n            <div class=\"plain-dock-icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n                <rect width=\"20\" height=\"20\" x=\"2\" y=\"2\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#3b82f6\"/>\n                <path d=\"M7 15c1 1.5 3 2 5 2s4-.5 5-2\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"9.5\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#fff\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"15.5\" cy=\"9.5\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#fff\"/>\n                <path d=\"M12 9v4\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"plain-dock-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n            <div class=\"plain-dock-tooltip\" role=\"tooltip\">Finder</div>\n          </a>\n\n          <!-- Safari -->\n          <a href=\"#safari\" class=\"plain-dock-item dock-safari\" aria-label=\"Safari\">\n            <div class=\"plain-dock-icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n                <rect width=\"20\" height=\"20\" x=\"2\" y=\"2\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#0284c7\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"7\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n                <polygon points=\"15.5 8.5 13.5 13.5 8.5 15.5 10.5 10.5\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"plain-dock-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n            <div class=\"plain-dock-tooltip\" role=\"tooltip\">Safari</div>\n          </a>\n\n          <!-- Terminal -->\n          <a href=\"#terminal\" class=\"plain-dock-item dock-terminal\" aria-label=\"Terminal\">\n            <div class=\"plain-dock-icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n                <rect width=\"20\" height=\"20\" x=\"2\" y=\"2\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#18181b\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.2)\"/>\n                <path d=\"m7 9 3 3-3 3\" stroke=\"#22c55e\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n                <path d=\"M13 15h4\" stroke=\"#22c55e\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"plain-dock-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n            <div class=\"plain-dock-tooltip\" role=\"tooltip\">Terminal</div>\n          </a>\n\n          <!-- VS Code -->\n          <a href=\"#code\" class=\"plain-dock-item dock-code\" aria-label=\"Code Editor\">\n            <div class=\"plain-dock-icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n                <rect width=\"20\" height=\"20\" x=\"2\" y=\"2\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#0284c7\"/>\n                <path d=\"M16.5 4.5 9 10.5l-4-3L3 8.5l3.5 3.5L3 15.5 5 16.5l4-3 7.5 6 4.5-2V6.5l-4.5-2Z\" fill=\"#38bdf8\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"plain-dock-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n            <div class=\"plain-dock-tooltip\" role=\"tooltip\">VS Code</div>\n          </a>\n\n          <!-- Music -->\n          <a href=\"#music\" class=\"plain-dock-item dock-music\" aria-label=\"Music\">\n            <div class=\"plain-dock-icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n                <rect width=\"20\" height=\"20\" x=\"2\" y=\"2\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#ec4899\"/>\n                <path d=\"M9 18V5l10-2v13\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"16\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"plain-dock-tooltip\" role=\"tooltip\">Music</div>\n          </a>\n\n          <!-- Messages -->\n          <a href=\"#chat\" class=\"plain-dock-item dock-chat\" aria-label=\"Messages\">\n            <div class=\"plain-dock-icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n                <rect width=\"20\" height=\"20\" x=\"2\" y=\"2\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#22c55e\"/>\n                <path d=\"M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 0 1-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"plain-dock-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n            <div class=\"plain-dock-tooltip\" role=\"tooltip\">Messages</div>\n          </a>\n\n          <!-- Divider -->\n          <div class=\"plain-dock-divider\" role=\"separator\"></div>\n\n          <!-- Settings -->\n          <a href=\"#settings\" class=\"plain-dock-item dock-settings\" aria-label=\"System Settings\">\n            <div class=\"plain-dock-icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n                <rect width=\"20\" height=\"20\" x=\"2\" y=\"2\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#71717a\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                <path d=\"M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83 2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2-2h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83 2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82.33H9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2 2v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33 1.82V9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"plain-dock-tooltip\" role=\"tooltip\">Settings</div>\n          </a>\n\n          <!-- Trash -->\n          <a href=\"#trash\" class=\"plain-dock-item dock-trash\" aria-label=\"Trash\">\n            <div class=\"plain-dock-icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e4e4e7\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n                <path d=\"M3 6h18M19 6v14c0 1-1 2-2 2H7c-1 0-2-1-2-2V6M8 6V4c0-1 1-2 2-2h4c1 0 2 1 2 2v2\"/>\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"plain-dock-tooltip\" role=\"tooltip\">Trash</div>\n          </a>\n        </nav>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Showcase 2: Vertical App Bar -->\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 2rem;\">\n      <h2 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #ffffff;\">Vertical Sidebar Dock</h2>\n      <div class=\"plain-showcase-box\" style=\"align-items: flex-start; padding-left: 4rem;\">\n        <nav class=\"plain-dock-wrapper plain-dock-vertical\" aria-label=\"Vertical Sidebar Dock\">\n          <a href=\"#dashboard\" class=\"plain-dock-item\" aria-label=\"Dashboard\">\n            <div class=\"plain-dock-icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect width=\"7\" height=\"9\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"/><rect width=\"7\" height=\"5\" x=\"14\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"/><rect width=\"7\" height=\"9\" x=\"14\" y=\"12\" rx=\"1\"/><rect width=\"7\" height=\"5\" x=\"3\" y=\"16\" rx=\"1\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"plain-dock-tooltip\" role=\"tooltip\">Dashboard</div>\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"#analytics\" class=\"plain-dock-item\" aria-label=\"Analytics\">\n            <div class=\"plain-dock-icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#a855f7\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 3v18h18\"/><path d=\"m19 9-5 5-4-4-3 3\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"plain-dock-tooltip\" role=\"tooltip\">Analytics</div>\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"#deployments\" class=\"plain-dock-item\" aria-label=\"Deployments\">\n            <div class=\"plain-dock-icon\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34d399\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m12 3-1.912 5.813a2 2 0 0 1-1.275 1.275L3 12l5.813 1.912a2 2 0 0 1 1.275 1.275L12 21l1.912-5.813a2 2 0 0 1 1.275-1.275L21 12l-5.813-1.912a2 2 0 0 1-1.275-1.275L12 3Z\"/></svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"plain-dock-tooltip\" role=\"tooltip\">Deployments</div>\n          </a>\n        </nav>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Technical Docs -->\n    <section class=\"plain-doc-section\">\n      <h2 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Proximity Physics via CSS :has() Combinators</h2>\n      <p style=\"color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n        Prior to CSS <code>:has()</code>, creating neighbor-sensitive proximity magnification required subscribing to <code>mousemove</code> events in JavaScript. Today, pure CSS selectors inspect subsequent and preceding sibling states declaratively:\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"plain-code-block\">\n<span class=\"token-comment\">/* 1. Direct hover on active dock item */</span>\n<span class=\"token-tag\">.plain-dock-item:hover</span> {\n  <span class=\"token-prop\">transform</span>: <span class=\"token-val\">translateY(-16px) scale(1.45)</span>;\n}\n\n<span class=\"token-comment\">/* 2. Immediate right neighbor (+1 sibling) */</span>\n<span class=\"token-tag\">.plain-dock-item:hover + .plain-dock-item</span> {\n  <span class=\"token-prop\">transform</span>: <span class=\"token-val\">translateY(-9px) scale(1.24)</span>;\n}\n\n<span class=\"token-comment\">/* 3. Immediate left neighbor (-1 sibling via :has relational selector) */</span>\n<span class=\"token-tag\">.plain-dock-item:has(+ .plain-dock-item:hover)</span> {\n  <span class=\"token-prop\">transform</span>: <span class=\"token-val\">translateY(-9px) scale(1.24)</span>;\n}\n\n<span class=\"token-comment\">/* 4. Second left/right neighbors for organic parabolic decay */</span>\n<span class=\"token-tag\">.plain-dock-item:hover + .plain-dock-item + .plain-dock-item</span>,\n<span class=\"token-tag\">.plain-dock-item:has(+ .plain-dock-item + .plain-dock-item:hover)</span> {\n  <span class=\"token-prop\">transform</span>: <span class=\"token-val\">translateY(-4px) scale(1.10)</span>;\n}\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "type": "registry:ui",
      "target": "src/components/ui/dock.html"
    }
  ],
  "categories": [
    "navigation"
  ],
  "meta": {
    "zeroJs": true,
    "framework": "html5",
    "tailwind": "v4",
    "modernApis": [
      ":has()",
